Package: com.martintrasak.fastmessaging
Name: fastMessaging
Description: Hold the right side of a DM to speed up the typing indicator
 Instagram plays a reel at 2x while you hold the right side of the screen.
 fastMessaging brings the same gesture to Direct: when the other person is
 typing, press and hold the right side of the thread and the three dots run
 faster for as long as you hold.
 .
 It starts at 2x and doubles every 1.5 seconds you keep holding, up to 16x.
 The speeds, the width of the strip and the hold delay are all in Settings.
 .
 The hold only engages while someone is actually typing, so Instagram's own
 press and hold, the chat theme picker and message reactions, behaves exactly
 as it always did the rest of the time.
